{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778613787981,"sessionID":"ses_1e25b77b0ffew7ZkI59x8wBqaQ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"functions.read:0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\n|Mondo Name | Mondo ID | Justification |\\n|--|--|--|--|\\n|cramps, familial adolescent| MONDO:0009027 | OMIM:218050 merged into [123320](https://www.omim.org/entry/123320) \\\"CREATINE PHOSPHOKINASE, ELEVATED SERUM\\\" |\\n|hereditary sensory and autonomic neuropathy type 1B|MONDO:0011961| OMIM Merged 608088\\nMOVED TO [614575](https://www.omim.org/entry/614575) \\\"CEREBELLAR ATAXIA, NEUROPATHY, AND VESTIBULAR AREFLEXIA SYNDROME\\\" |\\n| Charcot-Marie-Tooth peroneal muscular atrophy and Friedreich ataxia, combined | MONDO:0010553 | OMIM 302900 MOVED TO [302800](https://www.omim.org/entry/302800) |\\n|Usher syndrome type 1J | MONDO:0013935| OMIM 614869 MOVED TO [609439](https://www.omim.org/entry/609439) |\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\n(see justification column above)\\n\\n**Suggested term to consider**\\nMONDO:0009027 - > MONDO:0007402 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0011961  - > MONDO:0044720  (coordinate with Orphanet; UMLS CUI will likely merge in later)\\nMONDO:0010553 - > MONDO:0010549 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0013935 - > MONDO:0012273 (MedGen will keep our record IFF Mondo determines to keep this active for other sources/xrefs)\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\\n \",\n3:   \"comments\": [\n4:     {\n5:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach874nVLL\",\n6:       \"author\": {\n7:         \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n8:       },