NDO:0012273 (MedGen will keep our record IFF Mondo determines to keep this active for other sources/xrefs)\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\\n \",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach874nVLL\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"@kanems, thank you for this ticket. \\n\\nI will create PR to merge all these terms based on OMIM merges which conclude that the terms are of the same concepts. \\n\\nThanks. \",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-01T15:53:45Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9795#issuecomment-4171059915\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"[Obsolete] OMIM merges\",","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778613787965,"end":1778613787978}},"id":"prt_e1da49d35001CHM3rqqaSNF6MR","sessionID":"ses_1e25b77b0ffew7ZkI59x8wBqaQ","messageID":"msg_e1da4892b001OytagnSnE002KD"}}
